{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_024_simclr-title\">SimCLR</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">无动量教师或队列，以大 batch 内的两视图实例对和非线性投影头训练 NT-Xent。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Trains an encoder and non-linear MLP projection head via in-batch NT-Xent contrastive loss across dual augmented views without momentum queues.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一图像经两次随机增强得到的视图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pair of randomly augmented views (x̃_i, x̃_j) of the same image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可迁移的图像 encoder 表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Transferable visual representation h = f(x) (discarding projection head g after pretraining)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v119/chen20j.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_024_simclr')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_024_simclr')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SimCLR original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dc805b88c479dafb8c5a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_024_simclr\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_024_simclr')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_024_simclr\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">原始样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">一个 batch 中每幅图像作为一个实例类别。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests pair of randomly augmented views (x̃_i, x̃_j) of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"一个 batch 中每幅图像作为一个实例类别。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests pair of randomly augmented views (x̃_i, x̃_j) of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"原始样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">原始样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">一个 batch 中每幅图像作为一个实例类别。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests pair of randomly augmented views (x̃_i, x̃_j) of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"随机裁剪、翻转、颜色扰动等组合生成第一视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"增强视图 A\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">增强视图 A</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">随机裁剪、翻转、颜色扰动等组合生成第一视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"独立随机增强生成同一实例的第二视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 03 within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"增强视图 B\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 03\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">增强视图 B</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 03</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">独立随机增强生成同一实例的第二视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 03 within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两个视图通过完全共享参数的 ResNet 得到 h。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Encoder f within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"共享 Encoder f\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder f\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享 Encoder f</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Encoder f</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两个视图通过完全共享参数的 ResNet 得到 h。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Encoder f within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两层 MLP 将 h 映射到训练对比损失的 z 空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection g within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"非线性投影 g\" data-node-name-en=\"projection g\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">非线性投影 g</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection g</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两层 MLP 将 h 映射到训练对比损失的 z 空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection g within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"z 归一化后以内积表示余弦相似度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs L2 normalization within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"L2 归一化\" data-node-name-en=\"L2 normalization\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">L2 归一化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">L2 normalization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">z 归一化后以内积表示余弦相似度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs L2 normalization within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"2N 个视图两两比较；同源两视图为正对，其余为负对。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Batch matrix within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Batch 相似矩阵\" data-node-name-en=\"Batch matrix\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Batch 相似矩阵</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Batch matrix</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">2N 个视图两两比较；同源两视图为正对，其余为负对。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Batch matrix within the core siamese contrastive pretraining computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"温度缩放交叉熵拉近正对并推远 batch 内负对。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies NT-Xent to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"NT-Xent\" data-node-name-en=\"NT-Xent\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>NT-Xent</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">温度缩放交叉熵拉近正对并推远 batch 内负对。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies NT-Xent to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练后丢弃投影头，保留 encoder 输出微调或线性评估。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces transferable visual representation h = f(x) (discarding projection head g after pretraining) via representation h.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"下游表征 h\" data-node-name-en=\"representation h\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_024_simclr', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游表征 h</span><span class=\"lang-en\">representation h</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练后丢弃投影头，保留 encoder 输出微调或线性评估。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces transferable visual representation h = f(x) (discarding projection head g after pretraining) via representation h.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SimCLR Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · SimCLR 的批内 NT-Xent 对比目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Normalized Temperature-Scaled Cross-Entropy (NT-Xent) Contrastive Loss</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SimCLR：核心公式 · SimCLR 的批内 NT-Xent 对比目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"24\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"26.296613pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;ma