.933868\"></use><use x=\"-12.172284\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g23-50\" y=\"-50.1266\"></use><use x=\"-8.02683\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g16-35\" y=\"-50.1266\"></use><use x=\"-11.84501\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g16-58\" y=\"-42.862277\"></use><use x=\"-7.848657\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g4-61\" y=\"-42.862277\"></use><use x=\"-3.223203\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g23-49\" y=\"-42.862277\"></use><use x=\"2.571667\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g2-49\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"7.88026\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g16-58\" y=\"-44.465654\"></use><use x=\"11.876613\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g4-60\" y=\"-44.465654\"></use><use x=\"16.502067\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g16-56\" y=\"-44.465654\"></use><use x=\"21.282385\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g26-101\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"25.357101\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g26-120\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"30.338421\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g26-112\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"35.817875\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g13-185\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"39.533936\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g26-115\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"43.409402\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g26-105\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"46.179015\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g26-109\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"54.428082\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g13-185\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"58.383247\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g19-73\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"62.55759\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g16-56\" y=\"-44.465654\"></use><use x=\"65.677528\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g19-150\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"70.177267\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g19-73\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"74.678883\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g16-58\" y=\"-44.465654\"></use><use x=\"79.173357\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g13-186\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"82.989033\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g13-157\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"87.701357\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g19-103\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use><use x=\"92.782304\" xlink:href=\"#m024_g13-186\" y=\"-45.960035\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">监督预训练依赖人工标签，早期自监督常依赖手工 pretext task</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Supervised pretraining required costly manual labels, while early heuristic pretext tasks learned brittle representations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用两种增强视图和 NT-Xent/InfoNCE 学实例级表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Maximize agreement between differently augmented views of the same sample in a projected latent space while repelling all other batch samples.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">强增强、非线性 projection head、大 batch 与长训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Composition of strong augmentations, learnable non-linear MLP projection head g(·), and temperature-scaled cosine contrastive loss.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">医学中推动患者级、多视图和体数据对比学习</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Sparked patient-aware, multi-view, and slice-proximity contrastive learning across radiology and pathology.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">对比学习基础；医学增强和正负样本定义必须重设</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational contrastive SSL paradigm; requires large batch sizes and careful medical augmentation design to avoid false negatives.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">同一实例的两种增强定义正样本，batch 内其他实例同时充当负样本。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">强数据增强决定要学习的不变性，温度参数控制正负相似度分布的锐度。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">把对比目标放在投影空间可避免直接扭曲供下游使用的 encoder 表征。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Maximize agreement between differently augmented views of the same sample in a projected latent space while repelling all other batch samples.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Composition of strong augmentations, learnable non-linear MLP projection head g(·), and temperature-scaled cosine contrastive loss.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Normalized Temperature-Scaled Cross-Entropy (NT-Xent) Contrastive Loss.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">增强必须尊重医学语义：左右翻转、颜色扰动或强裁剪可能改变侧别、染色或病灶标签。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">大 batch 负样本需求在 3D 影像中代价高；同患者切片还可能成为假负样本。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Sparked patient-aware, multi-view, and slice-proximity contrastive learning across radiology and pathology.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational contrastive SSL paradigm; requires large batch sizes and careful medical augmentation design to avoid false negatives.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v119/chen20j.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>A Simple Framework for Contrastive Learning of Visual Representations</span>